{
  "_oracle": [
    "HAND-MAINTAINED independent oracle for the T19 vectors. Every entry was",
    "derived by reading design \u00a76.0's two state\u00d7event tables, the durability",
    "partition, the projection-machine rule, the observe_delta apply order,",
    "the per-row epoch algebra and the epoch-fold algorithm, then reviewed",
    "row by row against them; every derived hash (hold_id, recovery event_id)",
    "was reproduced with a standalone snippet over the schema's preimage",
    "spec, independent of the generated module.",
    "tools/fsmgen.py NEVER writes this file \u2014 test_pr0.py proves that by a",
    "membership test on fsmgen.build_outputs()'s real output set, and",
    "fsmgen --check treats any file appearing in this directory as drift.",
    "Comparison contract: movements/holds/recovery_appends compared exactly;",
    "halts compared per base_key on the CODE (detail strings are diagnostics,",
    "not contract) \u2014 plus deny vectors additionally assert the named fields",
    "in the halt detail, so a vector pins its RULE and not merely its code."
  ],
